    "detailed_description": "Are you ready to take your taste buds on a thrilling adventure? Step into the world of dim sum, where you'll become the tiniest yet most ambitious chef in town! <br><br>Bounce, leap, and somersault your way through an array of delectable, larger-than-life dim sum dishes, from fluffy pork buns to savory dumplings and everything in between. Can you conquer the culinary kingdom, one jump at a time? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/0869804c9672214d27ee2a491d5f542a.poster.avif?t=1700639121\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/0869804c9672214d27ee2a491d5f542a.webm?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/0869804c9672214d27ee2a491d5f542a.mp4?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>KOCO, where you'll meet a tasty lineup of classic Yue dim sum. From yummy shrimp dumplings to flavorful Shumai and soft steamed rice rolls, these treats are out to stop you in your tracks!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/53dc210af7763bca37ba46d9804f683d.poster.avif?t=1700639121\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/53dc210af7763bca37ba46d9804f683d.webm?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/53dc210af7763bca37ba46d9804f683d.mp4?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Here's the deal: the game is a piece of cake. Jump, dodge obstacles, and time it just right. Each level serves up different plates, each with its own quirks. And as you move forward, it gets tougher, mixing up the plates to keep you on your toes.<br><br>Sure, you might take a spill or two, but don't throw in the towel. Becoming a master chef is no cakewalk, but it's a deliciously fun ride!",
    "about_the_game": "Are you ready to take your taste buds on a thrilling adventure? Step into the world of dim sum, where you'll become the tiniest yet most ambitious chef in town! <br><br>Bounce, leap, and somersault your way through an array of delectable, larger-than-life dim sum dishes, from fluffy pork buns to savory dumplings and everything in between. Can you conquer the culinary kingdom, one jump at a time? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/0869804c9672214d27ee2a491d5f542a.poster.avif?t=1700639121\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/0869804c9672214d27ee2a491d5f542a.webm?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/0869804c9672214d27ee2a491d5f542a.mp4?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>KOCO, where you'll meet a tasty lineup of classic Yue dim sum. From yummy shrimp dumplings to flavorful Shumai and soft steamed rice rolls, these treats are out to stop you in your tracks!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/53dc210af7763bca37ba46d9804f683d.poster.avif?t=1700639121\" width=500 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/53dc210af7763bca37ba46d9804f683d.webm?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2672230/extras/53dc210af7763bca37ba46d9804f683d.mp4?t=1700639121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Here's the deal: the game is a piece of cake. Jump, dodge obstacles, and time it just right. Each level serves up different plates, each with its own quirks. And as you move forward, it gets tougher, mixing up the plates to keep you on your toes.<br><br>Sure, you might take a spill or two, but don't throw in the towel. Becoming a master chef is no cakewalk, but it's a deliciously fun ride!",
    "short_description": "Get ready for KOCO, a 3D jumping game where you become a little chef on a big adventure! In KOCO, you'll jump around gigantic food and tackle various challenges. These oversized dishes will do their best to stop you, so keep an eye on the clock and make it to the finish line!",
